The opening movement may be recorded schematically as $\text{word ``love''}
\longrightarrow
\text{mirror}
\longrightarrow
\text{observation of oneself}.$ This notation is only a compact guide to the lecture’s order. It is not a formal model. The point is that the word is not outside us. If we say love, the word has to disclose what we actually mean by it.

