p.src:
A useful bookkeeping distinction is $\begin{aligned}
\text{specialization} &\not\Longrightarrow \text{seriousness},\\
\text{knowledge} &\not\Longrightarrow \text{understanding of living}.\end{aligned}$ The inquiry into love begins only when this split is seen. Otherwise the mind brings its cleverness to the word love and merely makes a more refined confusion.

