p.src:
The final chain is therefore best written as $\text{love or compassion}
\longrightarrow
\text{intelligence}
\longrightarrow
\text{sensitivity to the situation}
\longrightarrow
\text{appropriate action}.$ The last term must remain open. The lecture refuses a precomputed answer. The situation, met with sensitivity, discloses what action is.

